// Tests for the B1 (`prompt_cache_key` affinity) and B2 (per-turn reasoning identity) fixes
// described in PROMPT-CACHE-WORK.md sections 4 and 5. `codex-reasoning-cache.ts` is the unit
// under test; the env-flag gate that chooses between `conversationKey` and `promptCacheKeyFor`
// lives in codex-oauth.ts and is covered separately in codex-oauth.test.ts.
